操。\n\n以上よろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kotomori_senri/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/21bfa6f1/uploads/origins/cc971eae-039d-44a8-9e51-e761415f7592?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b49471cc8035ece3367ec4ead9f8b016", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/21bfa6f1/uploads/origins/cc971eae-039d-44a8-9e51-e761415f7592?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b49471cc8035ece3367ec4ead9f8b016, https://si.imgix.net/21bfa6f1/uploads/origins/cc971eae-039d-44a8-9e51-e761415f7592?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3f7509f19698530a37e3a593c0b980e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/21bfa6f1/uploads/origins/cc971eae-039d-44a8-9e51-e761415f7592?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e541d5c516ca9b3b6a37807e2e926556 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "琴森せんり様\nシナモロールと一緒に料理する琴森せんりのイラストお願いします\n構図等はお任せいたします。\n宜しければお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kotomori_senri/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1991307040959139840%2F-2pUcV_H.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ded19edaad462fe668f5ec1b04a26bb1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1991307040959139840%2F-2pUcV_H.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ded19edaad462fe668f5ec1b04a26bb1, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1991307040959139840%2F-2pUcV_H.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47ef6237c30ea78b91b1e0ba8fa3fe64 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1991307040959139840%2F-2pUcV_H.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&